WEBVTT

00:00.430 --> 00:05.480
<b>Rosewood Academy</b>

00:02.020 --> 00:05.480
The battle royale: a special 
program at Rosewood Academy.

00:05.480 --> 00:10.230
<b><b>Testing Ground No. 2</b></b>

00:05.910 --> 00:10.230
A valuable exercise where each student uses 
the fruits of their training to compete.

00:10.790 --> 00:12.780
Or at least it was supposed to be...

00:13.240 --> 00:16.740
Parent's gone and won all by himself!

00:17.160 --> 00:19.780
Have no fear! I'm still here!

00:19.780 --> 00:22.330
With my drill lance's Absolute Defense!

00:23.710 --> 00:27.120
Ah, that move is a real pain in the neck.

00:27.120 --> 00:28.620
Do your best, Leonard!

00:28.620 --> 00:30.510
You're the last one standing!

00:30.510 --> 00:32.190
Avenge us!

00:32.190 --> 00:34.800
Would it hurt to lose every 
once in a while, Blade?

00:34.800 --> 00:40.680
Take the loss! Take the loss!

00:35.610 --> 00:37.090
Why am <i>I</i> the bad guy here?

00:37.090 --> 00:40.680
That is because almost everyone 
here was defeated by you, Master.

00:41.160 --> 00:43.560
Ah, well, I guess that makes sense.

00:43.560 --> 00:45.070
Leonard!

00:45.070 --> 00:47.550
Please give it all you've got!

00:47.550 --> 00:49.400
Even if we may both fall here...

00:49.400 --> 00:54.740
I swear to bring victory upon your name,
 my lord, Earnest Flaming!

00:54.740 --> 00:57.590
Leonard! You can do it!

00:57.590 --> 00:59.230
C'mon! Anna, cheer him on!

00:59.230 --> 01:01.990
Huh? Leonard hasn't been knocked out yet?

01:02.430 --> 01:04.370
Why's <i>he</i> of all people still standing?

01:05.520 --> 01:09.150
Blade's the kind who leaves 
his carrots for last.

01:09.150 --> 01:12.130
Oh, he puts off the things he hates?

01:13.260 --> 01:15.010
Leonard! Get back on your feet!

01:15.840 --> 01:17.510
Cut it out with that skeleton!

01:18.010 --> 01:20.040
Here I go!

01:23.520 --> 01:25.090
Knew it.

01:25.090 --> 01:27.020
We're talking about Leonard here.

01:29.970 --> 01:33.890
Say what you will, but I still have my lord!

01:33.890 --> 01:36.170
I can finally eat now!

01:39.060 --> 01:41.510
Hey, let's go grab some food.

01:41.510 --> 01:42.540
Thank you.

01:43.540 --> 01:45.540
I really don't stand a chance against you.

02:00.220 --> 02:04.230
<i>I look in your eyes, and I'm met with</i>

02:04.230 --> 02:08.780
<i>A brand-new me and dream</i>

02:18.820 --> 02:21.530
<i>Bravery? Naturally?</i>

02:21.530 --> 02:24.120
<i>Polar opposites within the heart</i>

02:24.120 --> 02:26.790
<i>But, you know, wanting to have both</i>

02:26.790 --> 02:29.420
<i>That's the saga of human nature</i>

02:29.420 --> 02:31.980
<i>Oh no, don't mind me</i>

02:31.980 --> 02:34.920
<i>Go ahead, and so on, you know the rest</i>

02:34.920 --> 02:37.180
<i>A little more? Wait, even harder?!</i>

02:37.180 --> 02:40.090
<i>Going overboard much?</i>

02:40.090 --> 02:42.100
<i>Those selfish emotions deep down</i>

02:42.100 --> 02:44.680
<i>Bringing them to light is 
what friendship's about</i>

02:44.680 --> 02:47.690
<i>Spending adolescence duking it out with pals</i>

02:47.690 --> 02:50.940
<i>I don't wanna lose</i>

02:51.360 --> 02:54.240
<i>We're off to the cutting edge moment</i>

02:54.240 --> 02:58.070
<i>Fight with best friends, and leave no regrets</i>

02:58.070 --> 03:03.030
<i>You should laugh, since 
you look best with a smile</i>

03:03.030 --> 03:08.660
<i>On the ropes?! No matter 
what we face, et cetera</i>

03:08.660 --> 03:11.670
<i>Just sit back and enjoy it</i>

03:11.670 --> 03:18.860
<i>Whatever may come, I'll 
be here to protect you</i>

03:26.060 --> 03:28.970
<b>Episode 9</b>

03:26.760 --> 03:28.970
<b>The Superorganism Suppression Committee</b>

03:28.970 --> 03:31.980
<b>Rosewood Academy Residence Hall</b>

03:31.980 --> 03:33.980
<b>Maria's Room, Bath</b>

03:40.560 --> 03:43.410
Hm... You of all people...

03:43.410 --> 03:44.280
Mao.

03:44.280 --> 03:47.430
Oh, I was just a bit surprised.

03:51.000 --> 03:53.250
<b>Leonard's Room</b>

03:55.240 --> 03:58.340
<i>Well... I had already realized it.</i>

03:58.920 --> 04:01.450
<i>Blade really is so strong.</i>

04:01.450 --> 04:03.010
<i>There will always be someone better.</i>

04:03.010 --> 04:05.090
<i>I know that's only obvious.</i>

04:07.620 --> 04:11.390
<i>If I can defeat Blade,
 I'm sure that the Empress...</i>

04:16.020 --> 04:17.320
<i>Can I defeat him?</i>

04:18.860 --> 04:21.820
That's right! I should begin 
by repairing my weapon!

04:23.820 --> 04:26.320
<b>Rosewood Academy</b>

04:26.320 --> 04:28.280
<b><b>Courtyard</b></b>

04:30.710 --> 04:31.700
Are you okay with this?

04:32.050 --> 04:33.900
Is something the matter, Maria?

04:33.900 --> 04:37.300
You want to defeat Blade, but you can't.

04:37.300 --> 04:40.150
You lost to him, but you're 
calmly laughing it off.

04:40.150 --> 04:41.460
Are you okay just staying like this?

04:43.380 --> 04:44.630
You wouldn't understand.

04:44.930 --> 04:46.680
I can't say I do.

04:46.680 --> 04:49.200
I don't want to be behind Blade.

04:49.200 --> 04:51.390
What I want is to stand by his side.

04:53.390 --> 04:55.470
It's frustrating to lose to him,

04:55.470 --> 04:57.650
though I've never actually faced him.

04:58.350 --> 05:02.900
But I swear that one day, I'll stand at his side
 because of my own ability.

05:03.440 --> 05:05.570
Could it be that you...

05:05.570 --> 05:08.630
Ah, no! I-I didn't mean it in that way!

05:08.630 --> 05:10.950
It's like Mao always says!

05:11.660 --> 05:13.670
I shall be the one to kill you!

05:13.670 --> 05:14.750
It's like that!

05:14.750 --> 05:16.710
A declaration of rivalry!

05:20.060 --> 05:22.210
Do you want to kill Blade?

05:22.210 --> 05:22.840
Huh?!

05:22.840 --> 05:25.600
N-No, I don't want to do that at all!

05:25.600 --> 05:28.280
I'm sure Mao doesn't really 
want to kill him, either!

05:28.280 --> 05:29.970
Huh? That part is true?

05:29.970 --> 05:31.890
Seriously?!

05:31.890 --> 05:33.270
I've come to my senses.

05:33.270 --> 05:36.350
You said all that to try and
 light a fire under me.

05:37.480 --> 05:41.860
When I saw you trying to put 
yourself down compared to Blade...

05:42.570 --> 05:48.560
I couldn't bear to see you cast aside
 your desire to rival him, and defeat him.

05:48.560 --> 05:49.600
I'm sorry!

05:49.600 --> 05:51.870
I was being selfish.

05:52.130 --> 05:53.990
Please, raise your head.

05:53.990 --> 05:56.370
I should be the one thanking you.

05:56.820 --> 06:00.960
I must defeat him at any cost.

06:03.460 --> 06:07.220
Or else my lord will not 
see fit to look my way.

06:08.990 --> 06:10.090
I'm rooting for you!

06:11.270 --> 06:12.410
I'll be rooting for you, as well.

06:12.410 --> 06:12.860
Yes!

06:12.860 --> 06:15.600
Hold it right there for just one moment!

06:15.600 --> 06:17.420
Rooting this, rooting that.

06:17.420 --> 06:18.540
Give me a break.

06:18.540 --> 06:20.580
So it amounts to nothing more than idealism?

06:20.580 --> 06:21.610
How laughable.

06:21.610 --> 06:23.830
Utterly preposterous.

06:24.360 --> 06:26.280
Pretend to be friends all you want!

06:26.280 --> 06:27.590
Live up your youth all you want!

06:27.590 --> 06:29.650
Heck, be as idealistic as you want!

06:29.650 --> 06:30.610
However!

06:30.610 --> 06:34.870
Do you think you can beat that 
superorganism like that?!

06:35.260 --> 06:37.230
Huh? W-Well, um...

06:37.230 --> 06:38.210
Hm?

06:38.210 --> 06:40.670
I don't mean to criticize you.

06:40.670 --> 06:43.880
But if you seriously want 
to take that thing down,

06:43.880 --> 06:45.880
I can lend a hand.

06:47.720 --> 06:50.990
Yes, with a realistic plan
 instead of idealism!

06:50.990 --> 06:54.390
Using this gray matter of mine!

06:54.390 --> 06:56.780
Thanks, um...

06:57.490 --> 06:59.140
Who are you?

06:59.180 --> 07:01.370
Eliza!

07:03.860 --> 07:10.860
Heaven and earth alike shall not 
tolerate this transcended being!

07:03.860 --> 07:10.860
<b>First Superorganism Suppression Committee Session</b>

07:10.860 --> 07:14.870
<b>Chairman: Leonard</b>

07:10.860 --> 07:14.870
I thank you all for gathering 
here on this day.

07:14.870 --> 07:17.410
<b>Empress: Earnest</b>

07:14.870 --> 07:17.410
Hey, why are you the chairman?

07:17.410 --> 07:20.080
<b>Gray Matter: Eliza</b>

07:17.410 --> 07:20.080
More like, Empress, why are you here?

07:20.080 --> 07:22.330
<b>Demon King's Daughter: Maria</b>

07:20.080 --> 07:22.330
Because this meeting 
is about defeating Blade!

07:22.330 --> 07:24.170
I want to beat him to a bloody pulp!

07:24.170 --> 07:26.170
<b>Guardian: Iona</b>

07:24.170 --> 07:26.170
Eradication is my specialty.

07:26.170 --> 07:27.980
Whatever, let's just get it over with!

07:26.170 --> 07:29.090
<b>Assassin: Kassim</b>

07:26.170 --> 07:29.090
<b>Swordsman: Clay</b>

07:27.980 --> 07:29.090
Yeah!

07:30.620 --> 07:35.690
Though we share not the day of our births, 
we swear here an oath of fellowship,

07:35.690 --> 07:38.100
to challenge the transcended 
one who defies logic—

07:36.890 --> 07:38.100
What the heck does that mean?

07:40.820 --> 07:41.710
Leonard!

07:41.710 --> 07:43.540
Guts! You've got to show some guts!

07:43.540 --> 07:44.610
Guts!

07:45.390 --> 07:46.420
In other words!

07:46.420 --> 07:51.050
All of us may have different motives, 
but we all want to beat the superorganism!

07:51.030 --> 07:55.620
<b>Artificial Hero: Sophitia Femto</b>

07:51.030 --> 07:55.620
<b>Baby Dragon: Cu Chulainn</b>

07:51.320 --> 07:54.290
I'm fine as long as Blade is happy.

07:54.290 --> 07:55.620
Parent!

07:57.210 --> 08:00.830
D-Does anyone here have 
a specific plan in mind?

08:00.830 --> 08:04.670
<b>Healer: Claire</b>

08:00.830 --> 08:04.670
<b>Spy: Yessica</b>

08:01.130 --> 08:02.120
Here!

08:02.120 --> 08:03.550
Attack him in his sleep!

08:03.550 --> 08:04.670
Poison him?

08:04.670 --> 08:06.580
What? That's cowardly.

08:06.580 --> 08:08.920
No, there's nothing cowardly about it.

08:08.920 --> 08:13.550
In fact, wouldn't you say that being a 
superorganism is about as cowardly as it gets?

08:13.930 --> 08:15.340
Mm-hmm.

08:15.340 --> 08:16.140
Mm-hmm!

08:16.140 --> 08:22.810
<b>Illustrative Footage from Superorganism Simulator</b>

08:16.490 --> 08:20.240
We feeble humans are trying 
to take on a superorganism!

08:20.240 --> 08:22.810
It's only natural that we use whatever 
methods are available to us!

08:23.410 --> 08:26.760
I want to fight him fair and square.

08:26.760 --> 08:30.040
I mean, Blade only ever uses a sword.

08:30.040 --> 08:33.900
Why don't we challenge him with weapons 
he'd be weak against, like lances or bows?

08:34.280 --> 08:39.280
How's that different from attacking 
him in his sleep or poisoning him?

08:39.780 --> 08:41.410
Um, look...

08:41.410 --> 08:43.830
What my lord is saying is that, well...

08:43.830 --> 08:48.390
We should each face him with 
whatever methods we see fit.

08:48.390 --> 08:49.920
That's what she means, yep.

08:49.920 --> 08:51.450
Y-Yeah, that's right!

08:51.450 --> 08:53.120
That's what I meant to say!

08:54.160 --> 08:55.010
Really?

08:55.010 --> 08:56.300
Really!

08:56.760 --> 08:58.240
Ladies and gentlemen!

08:58.240 --> 09:03.350
Let us declare here our vow to defeat Blade,
and achieve victory without fail!

09:05.190 --> 09:07.850
All in the name of suppressing 
the superorganism in battle!

09:11.360 --> 09:13.360
<b>Rosewood Academy, Testing Ground No. 2</b>

09:13.360 --> 09:17.110
<b>Super Drill Lance Mk. II</b>

09:13.900 --> 09:15.490
Let's fight fair and square!

09:15.490 --> 09:17.110
Prepare yourself, Blade!

09:18.060 --> 09:20.510
Here I go!

09:21.370 --> 09:22.870
<b>Second Superorganism Suppression Committee Session</b>

09:23.930 --> 09:25.750
Thanks for letting me use your lance.

09:24.940 --> 09:26.520
I'd just fixed this thing!

09:26.520 --> 09:28.130
I'm up next!

09:28.130 --> 09:31.130
<b>Rosewood Academy Residence Hall, Late at Night</b>

09:28.800 --> 09:31.130
There's no point fighting 
him when he's awake.

09:31.130 --> 09:34.130
<b>Blade's Bedroom</b>

09:32.060 --> 09:34.130
Okay, he's fast asleep!

09:34.130 --> 09:35.700
Good, good...

09:38.340 --> 09:39.760
Huh? Iona?

09:39.760 --> 09:44.020
H-Hey, hey! Wait, wait, wait! Wait!

09:44.520 --> 09:48.020
<b>Third Superorganism Suppression Committee Session</b>

09:48.020 --> 09:50.930
Hey, I thought we were on the same side.

09:50.930 --> 09:52.430
That was an automatic function.

09:52.430 --> 09:54.280
It's no good when he's asleep, either?

09:54.850 --> 09:56.780
Then I'll take him on next!

09:56.780 --> 09:59.780
<b>Full Armor Drill Lance Perfect Pack Repair</b>

09:57.690 --> 09:59.780
With my renovated lance!

10:00.170 --> 10:01.020
Blade!

10:01.020 --> 10:02.840
Today is the day that I surpass you!

10:02.840 --> 10:04.830
I really think you should just give up.

10:05.250 --> 10:06.880
Enough talk!

10:06.880 --> 10:08.670
Now face me in a fair fight!

10:13.370 --> 10:14.590
Yeesh...

10:15.800 --> 10:17.550
<b>Fourth Superorganism Suppression Committee Session</b>

10:17.550 --> 10:20.460
Duct tape ain't gonna cut it, huh?!

10:18.960 --> 10:21.550
Mao and I will avenge the chairman!

10:21.550 --> 10:23.680
<b>Rosewood Academy Cafeteria</b>

10:24.120 --> 10:25.890
You're wide... open!

10:27.570 --> 10:30.100
Have you forgotten that 
I am the one who will kill—

10:31.650 --> 10:33.020
In the middle of my introduction...

10:33.020 --> 10:34.280
How cowardly...

10:34.900 --> 10:37.900
<b>Fifth Superorganism Suppression Committee Session</b>

10:35.820 --> 10:37.900
Mao, you talk too much.

10:37.900 --> 10:41.570
<b>Testing Ground No. 2, Once Again</b>

10:38.680 --> 10:41.100
These are my only weapons.

10:44.990 --> 10:48.620
<b>Sixth Superorganism Suppression Committee Session</b>

10:45.420 --> 10:48.620
I'm fine as long as Blade is happy.

10:48.620 --> 10:50.540
<b>Rosewood Academy Cafeteria</b>

10:48.620 --> 10:52.000
Hi-yah!

10:53.670 --> 10:55.800
<b>Seventh Superorganism Suppression Committee Session</b>

10:54.410 --> 10:55.800
I knew it...

10:55.800 --> 10:57.160
If we're together...

10:55.800 --> 10:58.550
<b>Testing Ground No. 2</b>

10:57.160 --> 10:58.550
We have nothing to fear!

11:01.520 --> 11:02.720
Ah!

11:02.720 --> 11:05.980
Look, over there, a naked lady!

11:06.500 --> 11:08.560
So what if there's a naked lady?

11:10.350 --> 11:13.150
<b>Eighth Superorganism Suppression Committee Session</b>

11:10.700 --> 11:11.840
Naked...

11:11.840 --> 11:13.150
Lady...

11:13.150 --> 11:15.650
<b>Rosewood Academy Cafeteria</b>

11:13.760 --> 11:15.650
Prepare yourself, Parent!

11:16.050 --> 11:18.240
It's too spicy!

11:18.240 --> 11:19.190
It's good, you know?

11:19.650 --> 11:21.980
Eek! I've tripped!

11:19.900 --> 11:23.030
<b>Operation Klutzy Dumbbell Accident</b>

11:21.980 --> 11:23.030
Whoopsie-daisy!

11:23.480 --> 11:24.660
It didn't work.

11:24.660 --> 11:25.470
Are you okay?

11:25.470 --> 11:26.610
Go!

11:26.280 --> 11:29.290
<b>Rock-Paper-Scissors</b>

11:26.610 --> 11:28.310
Here we go!

11:28.310 --> 11:29.770
Rock, paper, scissors, shoot!

11:29.910 --> 11:31.580
Rock, paper, scissors, shoot!

11:31.690 --> 11:33.340
Rock, paper, scissors, shoot!

11:33.340 --> 11:33.990
Shoot!

11:34.100 --> 11:34.720
Shoot!

11:34.720 --> 11:35.600
Shoot! Shoot! Shoot!

11:35.600 --> 11:37.550
Shoot, shoot, shoot, shoot, shoot!

11:37.550 --> 11:39.920
<b>Rosewood Academy Infirmary</b>

11:38.310 --> 11:39.920
Looks like tenosynovitis.

11:39.920 --> 11:42.250
His wrists are way too strong!

11:42.250 --> 11:44.590
You just suck at rock-paper-scissors.

11:44.590 --> 11:47.010
So hot!

11:44.590 --> 11:49.850
<b>Endurance Contest</b>

11:47.010 --> 11:49.850
-Hot, hot, hot, hot, hot!

11:48.330 --> 11:49.850
-Don't overdo it.

11:49.850 --> 11:53.100
<b>Endurance Contest 2</b>

11:49.850 --> 11:53.100
-No way, no way, no way, no way!

11:51.410 --> 11:53.100
-Why'd you even try it?

11:53.100 --> 11:55.140
My lord!

11:53.100 --> 11:55.860
<b>Endurance Contest 3</b>

11:55.860 --> 11:58.570
That lousy superorganism!

11:55.860 --> 12:00.860
<b>Eleventh Superorganism Suppression Committee Session</b>

11:58.570 --> 11:59.640
-Anna...

11:58.570 --> 12:00.860
-That stupid moron!

11:59.640 --> 12:00.860
-Let's calm down.

12:01.380 --> 12:04.520
I know. Let's draw lots next.

12:04.520 --> 12:07.810
We'll fill it with only losing lots, 
and then Blade can...

12:08.930 --> 12:13.120
Everyone, what was our original goal again?

12:13.120 --> 12:14.050
I forgot!

12:14.050 --> 12:14.960
Um...

12:14.960 --> 12:15.790
Searching...

12:16.360 --> 12:17.700
I want to defeat him!

12:17.700 --> 12:19.400
Beat him to a bloody pulp!

12:19.400 --> 12:22.810
And then make him say, 
"Earnest, you're so strong!"

12:22.810 --> 12:23.450
Argh!

12:23.450 --> 12:24.740
That's right.

12:24.740 --> 12:26.760
However, my lord...

12:26.760 --> 12:30.310
In the search to be recognized, 
rather than victory,

12:31.240 --> 12:34.190
could it be that the very process 
is what truly gives it meaning?

12:34.190 --> 12:35.650
Leonard...

12:35.650 --> 12:38.190
Wow, I never thought you'd talk back to Anna!

12:38.190 --> 12:40.530
None of that matters if you don't win!

12:40.530 --> 12:41.840
We need to beat him at least once!

12:41.840 --> 12:43.340
I don't care what it is, as long as we win!

12:43.340 --> 12:45.450
I just want to make him say uncle!

12:45.450 --> 12:46.270
Argh!

12:46.270 --> 12:47.820
"Say uncle"?

12:48.240 --> 12:49.080
Say uncle.

12:49.080 --> 12:52.390
In ancient language,
 it means "to admit defeat."

12:52.390 --> 12:54.330
In that case, it is possible.

12:54.750 --> 12:56.620
I give, I give!

12:56.620 --> 12:57.940
I admit defeat.

12:57.940 --> 12:59.970
You're right! He said he gave up!

12:59.970 --> 13:00.790
You're right!

13:00.920 --> 13:01.840
You're right!

13:03.840 --> 13:08.540
The core of that strategy was that 
we used Iona's life as a hostage.

13:08.540 --> 13:09.310
Yes.

13:09.310 --> 13:11.820
This means that if we take 
hostages this time as well,

13:11.820 --> 13:14.590
it should be possible to defeat Master.

13:16.040 --> 13:18.530
Leonard? What's wrong?

13:19.090 --> 13:21.070
Well... taking hostages...

13:21.070 --> 13:22.950
We can defeat Blade!

13:22.950 --> 13:24.720
I'll drink swamp water 
if that's what it takes!

13:24.720 --> 13:26.100
Got it?!

13:26.100 --> 13:27.700
What unbridled passion!

13:28.420 --> 13:30.070
I understand, my lord.

13:30.070 --> 13:32.950
If that is your wish, I will spare no effort.

13:32.950 --> 13:35.170
Let's do it, everyone!

13:38.760 --> 13:40.710
My drill is burning up as it spins!

13:40.710 --> 13:41.960
Huh...

13:41.960 --> 13:44.460
<b>Superorganism Suppression Committee, Operation Hostage</b>

13:45.010 --> 13:46.340
As you can see,

13:46.340 --> 13:50.930
the medical approach here is fundamentally 
different from that of healing magic.

13:51.530 --> 13:54.980
Knowing how to heal the 
human body can come in handy.

13:54.980 --> 13:59.770
If you know how to heal it,
 you also know how to injure it.

13:59.770 --> 14:01.940
I know that!

14:01.940 --> 14:04.330
Hey, Leonard and the others aren't here.

14:04.330 --> 14:04.950
What?

14:04.950 --> 14:06.500
Th-That's not true!

14:06.500 --> 14:07.490
Oh, you know!

14:07.490 --> 14:10.830
Those three had to go run an errand, I think!

14:10.830 --> 14:11.970
What kind of errand?

14:11.970 --> 14:14.480
You don't need to worry about that, Blade.

14:14.480 --> 14:15.330
Nope.

14:16.840 --> 14:18.820
Look here!

14:18.820 --> 14:20.880
This place is under <i>our</i> control now!

14:20.880 --> 14:21.640
Now!

14:21.640 --> 14:22.540
Now!

14:22.540 --> 14:23.720
What is that?

14:23.720 --> 14:25.550
Ah! Those are...

14:25.550 --> 14:27.170
Terrorists!

14:27.170 --> 14:28.220
We're terrorists!

14:28.220 --> 14:29.130
Terrorists!

14:29.130 --> 14:30.550
Terrorists!

14:31.120 --> 14:32.550
Terrorists?

14:32.550 --> 14:37.290
It refers to people who use violence 
to achieve their political goals.

14:37.290 --> 14:38.390
Political?

14:38.390 --> 14:40.500
Political!

14:40.500 --> 14:41.470
I don't get it.

14:41.470 --> 14:43.510
It means they're rowdy and rude!

14:43.510 --> 14:44.570
I see.

14:44.570 --> 14:45.820
I see!

14:45.820 --> 14:47.600
Who <i>are</i> you people?!

14:47.600 --> 14:49.380
Just shut up and do as we say!

14:49.380 --> 14:52.780
Sorry, there's a reason for all this, 
so please play along!

14:52.780 --> 14:53.490
What?

14:53.490 --> 14:55.910
If this doesn't concern you, get out!

14:56.340 --> 14:57.930
Get out!

14:58.040 --> 14:59.210
Get out!

14:59.780 --> 15:01.700
You need to stay in here!

15:01.700 --> 15:03.340
Why? What's going on?

15:03.340 --> 15:04.940
Can't you tell?!

15:04.940 --> 15:06.710
They've taken our teacher hostage!

15:06.710 --> 15:07.630
Hostage?

15:07.630 --> 15:09.130
Hostage!

15:09.130 --> 15:10.780
She's our hostage!

15:10.780 --> 15:11.930
Hostage!

15:11.930 --> 15:15.880
Oh, no! Help me, Blade!

15:15.880 --> 15:17.180
Blade!

15:17.290 --> 15:18.770
Blade!

15:19.000 --> 15:20.400
Blade!

15:20.400 --> 15:22.270
<i>Huh? No fair.</i>

15:22.270 --> 15:23.620
You, there!

15:23.620 --> 15:25.920
If you're going to take a hostage, 
it should be me!

15:24.950 --> 15:25.920
No, me!

15:25.920 --> 15:26.890
Me, too! Me, too!

15:26.890 --> 15:28.070
H-Hey.

15:28.070 --> 15:29.280
Why did you come over here?!

15:29.280 --> 15:31.540
No fair, I want in, too!

15:31.540 --> 15:34.510
As a high-spec machine, I am 
best suited to be held hostage.

15:34.510 --> 15:35.380
My performance—

15:35.380 --> 15:39.060
If we're talking high-spec, 
it should be a genius like me!

15:39.060 --> 15:41.790
I'm fine as long as Blade is happy.

15:41.790 --> 15:43.900
Hey! You can't all come over here!

15:43.900 --> 15:46.570
You're the one who came over first!

15:45.460 --> 15:46.570
Boo! Boo!

15:46.570 --> 15:49.050
I want Blade to save me, too!

15:49.050 --> 15:51.630
As a beloved, high-spec character, I am...

15:51.630 --> 15:53.570
I was the one who proposed the idea!

15:53.570 --> 15:57.060
I'm fine as long as Blade is happy.

15:55.160 --> 15:57.060
Must be nice to be young.

15:57.060 --> 15:57.970
Sophie!

15:57.970 --> 16:00.380
If you're fine with it, 
then you get out of here!

15:59.330 --> 16:01.840
I'm fine. I'm fine.

16:00.380 --> 16:02.310
It's not fair!

16:02.310 --> 16:03.540
What the heck are we doing?

16:03.540 --> 16:05.190
We might have a chance with this!

16:04.190 --> 16:06.000
Don't think about it too hard.

16:05.190 --> 16:06.820
Master, please give me a command.

16:07.590 --> 16:09.830
You can all live up your youth without me.

16:09.830 --> 16:11.320
Ah, sure.

16:11.320 --> 16:14.320
Oh, I've been taken hostage!

16:14.320 --> 16:16.680
H-Help me!

16:15.330 --> 16:16.680
Hey, Cu.

16:16.680 --> 16:18.310
What is it, Parent?

16:18.310 --> 16:20.920
What do you think the word "hostage" means?

16:20.920 --> 16:22.540
Non-perishable food?

16:22.540 --> 16:24.580
Non-perishable food, huh?

16:24.980 --> 16:27.970
Eek, help me!

16:24.980 --> 16:31.190
Those terrorists came here to accomplish 
their political goals with violence, right?

16:27.970 --> 16:31.190
Blade! Blade! Help me!

16:31.190 --> 16:33.140
Political!

16:31.190 --> 16:33.140
Hurry!

16:33.140 --> 16:34.590
I'm so scared!

16:33.140 --> 16:37.680
And they took the girls hostage, 
to keep them as non-perishable food.

16:34.590 --> 16:36.080
Huh? Blade?

16:36.080 --> 16:37.680
Huh? What are you doing?

16:37.680 --> 16:39.320
Blade, hurry!

16:37.680 --> 16:39.320
Exactly!

16:39.320 --> 16:41.220
You're so smart, Parent!

16:41.220 --> 16:42.710
I see.

16:42.710 --> 16:44.060
I don't get it at all.

16:44.060 --> 16:45.310
Don't get it at all!

16:45.750 --> 16:47.480
You nincompoop!

16:47.480 --> 16:48.310
Blockhead!

16:48.310 --> 16:49.300
Big fat dumb idiot!

16:49.300 --> 16:50.490
Superorganism!

16:50.490 --> 16:52.650
Your precious Earnest is in trouble!

16:52.650 --> 16:54.350
Take things a little more seriously!

16:54.350 --> 16:56.420
We're in trouble, too!

16:56.420 --> 16:57.240
Just look at us!

16:57.240 --> 16:59.630
My hands and feet and tentacles are tied.

16:58.360 --> 17:00.640
Blade, are you happy?

16:59.630 --> 17:01.770
I came up with this idea!

17:01.770 --> 17:02.680
This is so funny!

17:02.680 --> 17:04.250
Let's be serious here!

17:04.250 --> 17:06.750
Eek! Help us!

17:08.800 --> 17:12.260
Terrorists. Political. Violence.

17:13.410 --> 17:16.010
Hostages. Non-perishable food.

17:16.010 --> 17:17.540
I still don't get it.

17:17.540 --> 17:18.640
Don't get it!

17:18.640 --> 17:20.480
Stop it with the non-perishable food!

17:20.480 --> 17:22.790
Are you okay with us being eaten?!

17:22.790 --> 17:24.140
I am a good source of iron.

17:24.140 --> 17:26.520
Eek! Help us!

17:26.520 --> 17:28.580
H-Hurry up and surrender!

17:28.580 --> 17:30.360
Hey, can I ask you something?

17:30.360 --> 17:31.790
Wh-What?

17:31.790 --> 17:33.540
What have you been doing this whole time?

17:33.540 --> 17:35.450
Clay. Kassim. Leonard.

17:35.450 --> 17:37.200
Wham bam boom!

17:37.540 --> 17:38.450
You knew it was us?!

17:38.450 --> 17:39.450
Since when?

17:39.940 --> 17:41.700
Hm, from the start?

17:41.700 --> 17:43.200
H-How?!

17:43.200 --> 17:46.590
I mean, you can tell from the way 
you walk and stuff, can't you?

17:46.590 --> 17:47.710
Ah...

17:47.710 --> 17:50.090
Damn it! Take a hint, 
you lousy superorganism!

17:50.090 --> 17:52.210
Damn it! This was so embarrassing!

17:52.210 --> 17:54.210
So this is where it ends, huh?!

17:54.830 --> 17:56.200
See, told you.

17:56.200 --> 17:57.350
Damn it!

17:57.350 --> 18:01.170
So? What were you planning to 
do by taking the girls hostage?

18:01.900 --> 18:03.100
We're still going?

18:03.650 --> 18:06.230
Use them as non-perishable food, of course!

18:06.230 --> 18:07.300
Really?!

18:07.300 --> 18:08.980
Won't you reconsider it?

18:08.980 --> 18:10.780
You shouldn't be eating your friends.

18:10.780 --> 18:13.810
Wait, is Operation Hostage working?

18:14.790 --> 18:16.230
In that case...

18:16.230 --> 18:17.370
These boobs...

18:17.370 --> 18:18.600
and these boobs...

18:18.600 --> 18:20.700
belong to me!

18:20.700 --> 18:24.200
You should know when to stop!

18:27.750 --> 18:29.280
W-Well, Blade?

18:29.280 --> 18:31.350
Give up? Do you give up?!

18:31.350 --> 18:32.210
Why?

18:33.170 --> 18:34.840
Not giving up, huh?

18:36.930 --> 18:40.020
We know that you're weak against hostages.

18:40.020 --> 18:42.410
When you fought Iona,
 you couldn't lay a finger on her.

18:42.410 --> 18:43.960
Come now, admit your defeat!

18:43.960 --> 18:45.600
Admit your defeat!

18:45.600 --> 18:49.650
That was true back then, 
but it won't work this time.

18:50.310 --> 18:51.680
Putting up a bold front.

18:51.680 --> 18:53.800
What can you possibly do here?

18:53.800 --> 18:54.520
My lord!

18:55.580 --> 18:56.840
If I may.

18:56.840 --> 18:58.240
Please do.

18:59.570 --> 19:01.650
Ah! Help me!

19:01.650 --> 19:02.820
He's going to kill me!

19:04.390 --> 19:08.790
If I can't have you to myself, 
then I'll be the one to...

19:08.790 --> 19:09.930
Leonard...

19:09.930 --> 19:11.000
His eyes are dead serious.

19:12.130 --> 19:14.210
Give up? Give up yet?!

19:14.210 --> 19:15.530
Give up yet?

19:15.530 --> 19:17.000
Blade, what will you do?!

19:17.000 --> 19:18.010
What will you do?

19:18.620 --> 19:20.500
What will you do?!

19:23.180 --> 19:24.010
I'll do this.

19:29.100 --> 19:30.430
Huh?

19:30.430 --> 19:31.190
Eh?

19:33.190 --> 19:34.860
There, disarmed.

19:34.860 --> 19:36.560
Wh-What did you do?!

19:37.400 --> 19:39.990
I sliced up just your weapons 
and armor with my slashes.

19:39.990 --> 19:42.490
<b>Penetrating Force Demonstration Video</b>

19:40.370 --> 19:42.490
It's an application of penetrating force.

19:42.490 --> 19:44.270
M-My word!

19:44.270 --> 19:46.490
Th-That's completely absurd!

19:46.490 --> 19:48.750
This damn superorganism!

19:49.540 --> 19:51.210
Now that it's come to this...

19:52.010 --> 19:53.210
Now what?

19:59.960 --> 20:02.020
We'll all attack him at once!

20:02.020 --> 20:04.290
Oh? Hm? Oh?!

20:07.790 --> 20:09.930
So what was all this, anyway?

20:10.670 --> 20:13.190
Pretending to be terrorists.

20:13.190 --> 20:14.920
I get it now!

20:14.920 --> 20:16.730
So this was all make-believe!

20:16.730 --> 20:20.100
This is my first time playing 
a make-believe game!

20:20.100 --> 20:22.020
Oh, did I do it right?

20:22.020 --> 20:23.660
I don't know all the rules!

20:23.660 --> 20:25.780
You did just fine.

20:25.780 --> 20:27.250
Man, that's hilarious.

20:27.250 --> 20:28.450
I think I broke something.

20:28.450 --> 20:29.680
I broke some bones.

20:29.680 --> 20:30.500
Me, too.

20:30.500 --> 20:32.750
Master, you are wonderful 
when you show no mercy.

20:32.750 --> 20:34.550
Looks like we didn't stand a chance.

20:34.550 --> 20:36.610
That's Parent for you!

20:36.610 --> 20:39.160
I'm fine as long as Blade is happy.

20:39.160 --> 20:41.130
I hate this, but...

20:42.560 --> 20:45.890
Terrorists, will you 
show up tomorrow as well?

20:45.890 --> 20:47.390
No more!

20:53.890 --> 20:56.650
I won't ever give up!

20:56.650 --> 20:58.520
My lord!

21:00.320 --> 21:01.590
Ladies and gentlemen!

21:00.900 --> 21:05.660
<b>334th Superorganism Suppression Committee Session</b>

21:01.590 --> 21:04.030
Let us begin our 334th session!

21:04.030 --> 21:05.660
We're still doing this?

21:05.660 --> 21:07.110
Of course!

21:07.110 --> 21:09.310
We are the Superorganism 
Suppression Committee!

21:09.310 --> 21:12.910
Until we achieve our long-held dream,
 we will never give up!

21:13.660 --> 21:15.110
Exactly!

21:15.110 --> 21:16.890
I see you in a new light, Leonard.

21:17.830 --> 21:19.470
If it's for my lord...

21:19.470 --> 21:21.330
He sure has it rough.

21:21.330 --> 21:24.670
Does Anna not realize 
Leonard's feelings for her?

21:24.670 --> 21:26.680
Leonard, hang in there!

21:26.680 --> 21:29.750
Um, can't we give it up?

21:29.750 --> 21:32.420
No! This is our calling!

21:32.420 --> 21:33.170
Indeed!

21:33.170 --> 21:36.440
For man, as man alone,
 to surpass the superorganism!

21:37.340 --> 21:38.400
Let's work hard together.

21:38.400 --> 21:40.590
I'll make him say it for sure!

21:40.590 --> 21:41.990
"Earnest, you're amazing!"

21:41.990 --> 21:43.570
Prepare yourself, Blade!

21:42.510 --> 21:43.570
Together...

21:43.570 --> 21:46.000
I'll do all I can to make Blade cry!

21:46.000 --> 21:50.350
And say, "Earnest, I give up! Boo-hoo!"

21:50.350 --> 21:51.330
Boo-hoo...

21:51.590 --> 21:54.380
The chairman looks like he's 
going to burst into tears.

21:53.410 --> 21:55.080
Boo-hoo...

21:55.080 --> 21:56.580
I feel so sorry for him.

21:56.580 --> 21:59.110
Say uncle already, Blade!

21:59.110 --> 21:59.960
Uncle!

21:59.960 --> 22:01.630
Why are <i>you</i> saying it?!

22:01.630 --> 22:03.920
Uncle!

22:18.600 --> 22:23.660
<i>The sunny disposition that 
brings a smile to your face</i>

22:23.660 --> 22:29.410
<i>As well as the heroic sense of justice</i>

22:29.410 --> 22:34.580
<i>They may be a part of me, 
but that's not all there is</i>

22:34.580 --> 22:37.280
<i>That image of me</i>

22:37.280 --> 22:40.000
<i>Has taken on a life of its own</i>

22:40.000 --> 22:42.670
<i>Hey, wait up</i>

22:42.670 --> 22:45.090
<i>Won't you be friends with me?</i>

22:45.090 --> 22:49.780
<i>Let's shake hands, another self of mine</i>

22:50.440 --> 22:53.200
<i>The wounds we cannot bear alone</i>

22:53.200 --> 22:55.870
<i>The dangers that we keep hidden</i>

22:55.870 --> 22:58.540
<i>We're all hiding them within</i>

22:58.540 --> 23:01.530
<i>Standing ready to strike</i>

23:01.530 --> 23:03.960
<i>The shadow lurking beneath the light</i>

23:03.960 --> 23:08.240
<i>The muffled sounds coming from my lips</i>

23:08.240 --> 23:13.720
<i>They make me feel that I am alive</i>

23:13.720 --> 23:15.560
<i>It's a sign</i>

23:34.470 --> 23:39.930
<b>Next Time</b>

23:35.260 --> 23:39.930
<b>I'm Looking for Something Tastier than Me</b>
